WEBVTT

00:02:59.246 --> 00:03:00.996
When I say prison industry,

00:03:01.038 --> 00:03:03.496
I'm talking about food
service corporations

00:03:03.496 --> 00:03:05.996
that serve rotten meat
to people behind bars,

00:03:06.038 --> 00:03:09.413
health care providers
that deny incarcerated people care,

00:03:09.454 --> 00:03:14.163
and architecture firms that design
windowless six-by-nine-foot cells

00:03:14.204 --> 00:03:15.829
for solitary confinement,

00:03:15.871 --> 00:03:19.538
where people spend weeks,
months and even years.

00:03:20.121 --> 00:03:22.704
We invest in these corporations

00:03:22.746 --> 00:03:25.038
through our retirement funds,
public pensions,

00:03:25.079 --> 00:03:27.954
university endowments
and private foundations,

00:03:27.954 --> 00:03:29.621
and we celebrate their executives

00:03:29.663 --> 00:03:32.829
on the boards of our favorite
cultural institutions.